<title>UK: Crude units at Shell Stanlow shut - trade.</title>
<headline>Crude units at Shell Stanlow shut - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Both crude distillation units at Shell's Stanlow refinery have been shut since 1900 GMT on Monday due to problems with the boiler, traders at the company said.  </p>
<p>The refinery has a nameplate distillation capacity of 262,000 barrels per day. Sources were unable to say when the units would be back on stream.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7456</p>
</text>
